> f(a: u8, b: u8) = (a + b)/2
> g(a: u8, b: u8) = (a & b) + ((a xor b) >> 1)
> f2(a: u8, b: u8) = u8((a + b)/2)
> g2(a: u8, b: u8) = u8((a & b) + ((a xor b) >> 1))
> f1(a: u8, b: u8) = u8((a + b)/2)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 32640 points, e.g. a=255, b=1: 0 vs 128
> equiv f2 g2
f2 and g2 differ at 32640 points, e.g. a=255, b=1: 0 vs 128
> equiv f1 g
f1 and g differ at 32640 points, e.g. a=255, b=1: 0 vs 128
> equiv f f2
f and f2 are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
